      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "FlashFrost",
        "name": "Flash Frost",
        "summary": "Anivia brings her wings together and summons a sphere of ice that flies towards her opponents, chilling and damaging anyone in its path. When the sphere explodes it does moderate damage in a radius, stunning anyone in the area.",
        "bodyHtml": "Anivia fires a massive chunk of ice, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/70/90/110/130 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Chilling</span> enemies for 3 seconds, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by. At the end of its range, the ice detonates, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> enemies for 1.1/1.2/1.3/1.4/1.5 seconds and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200 + (45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br />Anivia can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this ability while the ice flies to detonate it early.",
