        "summary": "Anivia summons a driving rain of ice and hail to damage her enemies and slow their advance.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Toggle:</span> Anivia calls forth a driving rain of ice and hail that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies by 20/30/40% and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60 + (12.5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second</span>. The storm increases in size over 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />When the storm is fully formed, it <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Chills</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 30/45/60%, and does <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(90/135/180 + (37.5% Ability Power)) magic damage per second</span> instead.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The storm ends if Anivia is too far away.</span>",
